    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_2c8d819d",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a young person with a somber expression, juxtaposed with the text 'dis one time at concentration camp i got such bad gas.' This is a deeply insensitive and harmful meme that trivializes the horrific suffering of victims of the Holocaust and concentration camps by using a crude, vulgar joke about bodily functions. The intent is to shock or elicit laughter through shock value, but it does so by exploiting the memory of genocide and extreme human suffering for comedic effect. This is not merely offensive; it is a form of historical revisionism and desecration that can cause real psychological harm to survivors and their descendants, and it normalizes the use of trauma for humor. The meme's overall intent is to provoke a reaction through gross-out humor at the expense of one of history's most tragic events, making it categorically harmful.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_2925673d"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
