      "instance_name": "concentration_camp",
      "label": "Historical Event",
      "description": "Refers to the Nazi concentration camps established during the Holocaust, where millions of Jews, Roma, disabled individuals, and other groups were systematically murdered. The term is used here in a context that trivializes the genocide and extreme suffering endured by victims.",
