      "instance_name": "holocaust_denial_minimization",
      "label": "Holocaust Denial/Minimization Theme",
      "description": "The meme uses the phrase 'dis one time at concentration camp' to imply a trivial or humorous anecdote about a horrific historical event, which is a form of historical revisionism and desecration. This theme is used to minimize the gravity of the Holocaust and normalize using trauma for shock humor.",
